Z||000005||IwannaIRM||08-20-2001||12:19 PM||||In Texas they will give you a ticket for "Exhibition of Speed".  It's a BS ticket but it allows them to pull you over and get you for other things if they want.<P>The judgement or interpertation of your "Exhibition of Speed" is determined by the cop.  So, if you nail it, don't break traction, don't break the speed limit and the cops having a bad day your screwed.<P>I don't ever remember taking that course when I was a police officer but things have changed since then.<P><P>------------------<BR>AIM - SWags2933<P>84 Fiero SE (being modified)<BR>88 Formula||||reg||1
